</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.T4.fig2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S4.T4.fig2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">T2I-Compbench++ performance.<span id="S4.T4.fig2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Mask alignment enhances attribute binding, object relationships, and compositional understanding compared to the baseline.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
